  "content": "[Intro]\n[G5]\nI...\nI... I...\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D5]I'm stuck in the Life I was sure\nI left behind.\nA Place so hollow, there's\n[Eb5]nothing left to find.\n[D5]A Perfect Failure, A\nflawless Imperfection.\nJust A fading Shadow on the\n[Eb5]Path to my Extinction.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[D5]I've been down Roads where\n[E5]few will ever go. [Fdim]\n[Bb]I've seen the Dirt where all\n[Bbm]our Secrets [A]grow.\n[D5]From the Depths of A\n[E5]Life [Fdim]relentless. I'll\n[Eb]stay here down below.\n[Ebm]\n\n[Intrelude]\n[D5]\nDown Below!\n[Eb5]Because\n\n[Chorus]\n[G5]Time [F/A]\n[Bb5]\n[F/A]will [Bb]not heal\n[Eb]me!\n[Cm]\n[G5]\n[G5]Time [F/A]\n[Bb5]\n[F/A]will [Bb]not heal\n[Eb]me!\n[Cm]\n[G5]\n\n[Intrelude]\n[G5]\nA\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D5]Selfappointed Savior, u-\nnable to cure Myself.\nHere I Am, in my\n[Eb5]Hand A Tool of Death.\n[D5]My Rite begins when\neverything else has ended.\nTo rid the World of A\n[Eb5]Life so redundant\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[D5]I've been down Roads where\n[E5]few will ever go. [Fdim]\n[Bb]I've seen the Dirt where all\n[Bbm]our Secrets [A]grow.\n[D5]From the Depths of A\n[E5]Life [Fdim]relentless. I'll\n[Eb]stay here down below.\n[Ebm]Because\n\n[Chorus]\n[G5]Time [F/A]\n[Bb5]\n[F/A]will [Bb]not heal\n[Eb]me!\n[Cm]\n[G5]\n[G5]Time [F/A]\n[Bb5]\n[F/A]will [Bb]not heal\n[Eb]me!\n[Cm]\n[G5]\n\n[Solo 1]\n[Gm]\n[D/F#]  [D]\n[Gm]\n[Eb]  [D/F#]\n[Gm]\n[D/F#]  [D]\n[Gm]\n[Eb]  [D/F#]\n\n[Solo 2]\n[Gm]\n[D/F#]  [D]\n[Gm]\n[Eb]  [D/F#]\n[Gm]\n[D/F#]  [D]\n[Gm]\n[Eb]\n[D/F#]\n\n[Outro]\n[Gm]",
